          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " powder. The dish is intentionally dry with very little sauce. The spices coat each chickpea rather than surrounding them in a gravy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cook on medium-high heat and keep stirring. The aim is a dry, slightly charred finish on the chickpeas without burning the spices."
          }
        ]
